  "rules": [
    "Known positive facts contribute numerator and denominator; supported closed negatives contribute denominator only; unresolved trials contribute neither.",
    "VPIP first-action closure and PFR any-raise closure are evaluated separately.",
    "Identity omission cannot create a negative trial or a walk; proven CALL, RAISE and strict pre-boundary FOLD survive later uncertainty.",
    "Only unattributed preflop actions affect preflop trials; postflop-only ambiguity cannot erase a closed PFR negative.",
    "Delivered and synthesized FLOP use person support. FOLD_OPEN or Results presence alone proves neither participation nor nonparticipation.",
    "A direct UID showdown participant plus at least a flop board proves reach, even if the delivered 305 is after a seat boundary.",
    "Storage order inside a same-millisecond 301/action tie is not causal evidence."
  ],
